      "text": "[9:50PM] #Ijanikin #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth vehicular movement from Abule-Ado through Trade Fair, Ojo Barracks, Volkswagen, down to Iyana Iba.\nGood traffic conditions observed at Alaba Rago to Okokomaiko.\nIgbo-Elerin Junction to Mechanic, down to Iyana Isashi is good.\nIyana Era to Custom Checkpoint Ijanikin is smooth.\nMoving traffic at Iyana Iba towards Techno Oil Filling on Lasu Igando Road.\nAppreciable traffic movement from Ipaye Bus Stop to Iyana School, down to Obadore Bridge.\nFast-moving traffic on the return journey from Obadore Bridge back to Iyana Iba.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
